<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — Draft for Approval" description="Draft website terms for Ankit Jobs & Staffing India. Service, fee and candidate registration policies require business and legal approval before launch." noindex>
  <PageHero title="Clear Expectations. Informed Decisions." eyebrow="Terms & conditions" text="Draft content for business and legal review. Final service terms have not been supplied."/>
  <section class="section"><article class="container legal-content"><div class="draft-banner"><strong>Client and legal approval required.</strong><p>This page describes the present website and outstanding policies. It is not a finalized recruitment service agreement.</p></div><h2>About this website</h2><p>Ankit Jobs &amp; Staffing India is presented as a recruitment and job placement business serving candidates in Kolkata, Vizag and Odisha. The site provides career information and ways to make general enquiries.</p><h2>Candidate enquiries</h2><p>Online candidate submission is currently disabled. Using this website, making an enquiry or completing the browser-only form does not guarantee a vacancy, interview, selection or employment.</p><h2>Vacancies and selection</h2><p>No verified live vacancies were supplied for initial publication. Any future listing must be checked for accuracy and current availability. Employers make their own selection decisions and set the terms of employment.</p><h2>Terms awaiting approval</h2><ul><li>Applicable service fees, payments, cancellations and refunds.</li><li>Candidate responsibilities.</li><li>Service scope and contractual terms.</li><li>Complaints and dispute resolution procedures.</li><li>Governing terms, rights and liabilities following legal review.</li></ul><h2>Using contact links</h2><p>WhatsApp, telephone and email links connect you to external communication services. Keep enquiries general and do not send sensitive candidate details using these website links.</p><h2>Clarify before committing</h2><p>Contact <a href="/contact-us/">Ankit Rai</a> to confirm the terms relevant to your enquiry before sharing sensitive information, paying a fee or agreeing to a service.</p></article></section>
</Layout>
